  "softinsaBadges": "SOFTINSA BADGES",
  "termsOfServiceTitle": "Terms of Service",
  "termsOfServiceIntro": "Access to the Softinsa Badges Platform is restricted to authorized collaborators. These Terms of Service govern platform access, account management, evidence submission, badge validation, and the use of associated features.",
  "acceptTerms": "I have read and accept the terms",
  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Softinsa is committed to protecting your privacy and personal data. This Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, with whom we share it, and your rights under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).",
  "acceptPrivacy": "I have read and accept the policy",
  "termsAcceptanceTitle": "Terms acceptance",
  "termsAcceptanceBody": "By accessing or using the platform, the user declares having read, understood, and fully accepted these Terms. If you do not agree with any of the points, you should not use the platform.",
  "termsUsersTitle": "Covered users",
  "termsUsersBody": "The platform is exclusively intended for Softinsa collaborators, as well as managers (Talent Managers and Service Line Leaders) in the exercise of their duties.",
  "termsAccountTitle": "Account creation and security",
  "termsAccountBody": "The user commits to providing truthful, complete, and up-to-date information during registration. The password is personal and non-transferable. The user is responsible for all activities performed on their account. On first authentication, the user must change the provided password. The user may request password recovery through the email associated with the account.",
  "termsEvidenceTitle": "Evidence submission",
  "termsEvidenceBody": "To apply for a badge, the user must submit the requested evidence (certificates, diplomas, reports, etc.). The user declares that all submitted evidence is true, authentic, and belongs to them. Softinsa reserves the right to request additional documentation or reject evidence it considers insufficient or false.",
  "termsValidationTitle": "Validation and approval process",
  "termsValidationBody": "Applications will be analyzed first by the Talent Manager and then by the Service Line Leader of the respective area. The user will be notified by email about approvals, rejections, or correction requests. All decisions are final in accordance with Softinsa's internal regulations.",
  "termsBadgesTitle": "Obtaining and using badges",
  "termsBadgesBody": "A badge is awarded only when all requirements for a given level have been met. Some badges may have an expiration date, which is visible on the badge page. The user commits not to tamper with, falsify, or improperly use any badge.",
  "termsSharingTitle": "Badge publication and sharing",
  "termsSharingBody": "The user may authorize their badges to be displayed in the platform's public gallery. The user may voluntarily share their badges on LinkedIn or other professional networks. To include a badge in a corporate email signature, the user must enable this feature in account settings.",
  "termsGamificationTitle": "Scoring and gamification system",
  "termsGamificationBody": "Softinsa may assign points to each badge according to internally defined criteria. Points serve to identify talent and professional development, and may be considered in recognition or compensation processes. Even if a badge expires, the obtained score remains in the user's history.",
  "termsNotificationsTitle": "Notifications and reminders",
  "termsNotificationsBody": "By accepting these Terms, the user consents to receive email and/or push notifications regarding: badge application confirmation, approval or rejection of requests, badge expiration, and reminders of objectives and deadlines defined in the personal timeline.",
  "termsProhibitedTitle": "Prohibited conduct",
  "termsProhibitedBody": "The user should not: share their access credentials with third parties; use the platform for non-professional or unauthorized purposes; submit false evidence or evidence from third parties without consent; attempt to access other users' data without permission.",
  "termsSuspensionTitle": "Account suspension or cancellation",
  "termsSuspensionBody": "Softinsa reserves the right to suspend or cancel accounts in case of violation of these Terms, misuse of the platform, or upon request from the company's human resources.",
  "termsChangesTitle": "Terms changes",
  "termsChangesBody": "These Terms may be updated periodically. Changes will be communicated to users with a minimum advance notice of 15 days, except when required by law.",
  "termsLawTitle": "Applicable legislation",
  "termsLawBody": "These Terms are governed by Portuguese legislation. Any dispute will be submitted to the courts of the Lisbon district.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "Data controller",
  "privacyDataBody": "Softinsa is the entity responsible for processing your personal data within the Badges Platform.",
  "privacyCollectTitle": "What data do we collect?",
  "privacyCollectBody": "By using the platform, we may collect the following categories of data:\n\nProfessional identification data: name, corporate email, area of activity, and role in the company.\n\nAuthentication data: password (stored encrypted) and access history.\n\nEvidence data: certificates, diplomas, reports, and other documents the user submits for badge applications.\n\nBadge history: obtained badges, badges in validation process, and learning path progress.\n\nGamification data: assigned score, special achievements, and milestones reached.\n\nCommunication data: sent notifications, reminders, and contact preferences.",
  "privacyUseTitle": "How do we use your data?",
  "privacyUseBody": "Your data is used exclusively for the following purposes:\n\nAccount management and platform authentication.\n\nBadge application submission, validation, and approval.\n\nDigital badge issuance and publication.\n\nInternal rankings creation by area or Service Line for professional recognition purposes.\n\nNotifications about request status, badge expiration, and objective reminders.\n\nAggregated and anonymous report generation for platform improvement and talent management.\n\nPublic sharing only when the user expressly authorizes.",
  "privacyLegalTitle": "What is the legal basis for processing?",
  "privacyLegalBody": "The processing of your data is based on:\n\nExecution of the employment contract or professional training (competency management and progression).\n\nExplicit user consent for public badge sharing or integration with professional networks.\n\nSoftinsa's legitimate interest in managing internal talent, certifying competencies, and promoting continuous learning.\n\nApplicable legal obligations, particularly regarding archiving and auditing.",
  "privacyShareTitle": "With whom do we share your data?",
  "privacyShareBody": "Your data may be accessed or shared with:\n\nTalent Managers and Service Line Leaders within the badge validation process.\n\nPlatform administrators for technical management and configuration.\n\nSubcontracted technical providers (e.g., platform hosting, email service), who are contractually bound to the GDPR.\n\nProfessional networks (e.g., LinkedIn) only with the user's express authorization.\n\nPublic authorities when required by law.\n\nYour data is not sold or provided to third parties for marketing purposes.",
  "privacyBadgePageTitle": "Public badge page",
  "privacyBadgePageBody": "Each approved badge has a public page accessible via a unique link. This page contains only:\n\nConsultant's name\n\nObtained badge\n\nAward date\n\nCertified competencies\n\nThe user may request removal of the public page at any time by contacting the data protection officer.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "How long do we keep your data?",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "Data type and retention period:\n\nSubmitted evidence: During badge validity + 2 years\n\nNon-expiring badges: Indefinitely (professional history)\n\nAccess and decision history: 5 years after the last interaction\n\nRegistration data: While the user is active on the platform\n\nAfter these periods, data will be anonymized or securely deleted.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "What are your rights?",
  "privacyRightsBody": "As a data holder, you have the right to:\n\nAccess the personal data we process.\n\nRectify incomplete or outdated data.\n\nRequest deletion of your data, except for legal conservation obligations.\n\nLimit processing in certain circumstances.\n\nPortability of data you provided to us.\n\nObject to the creation of public rankings or badge sharing.\n\nWithdraw consent at any time, without compromising the lawfulness of processing carried out until then.\n\nYou can exercise these rights through the contact indicated in point 11.",
  "privacyProtectTitle": "How do we protect your data?",
  "privacyProtectBody": "We adopt adequate technical and organizational measures, including:\n\nEncrypted communication (HTTPS) between your device and the platform.\n\nEncrypted password storage.\n\nProfile-based access control.\n\nAudit logging for all validation and approval actions.",
  "privacyMinorsTitle": "Minors' data",
  "privacyMinorsBody": "The platform is exclusively intended for Softinsa collaborators, assuming all users are 18 years of age or older.",
